    "displayName": "Security Enterprise — Security Center",
    "description": "**Enterprise** — Zero-trust and regulatory alignment for Defender for Cloud: controls that require infrastructure investment or map directly to compliance frameworks. This tier delivers diagnostic settings streaming to Log Analytics / Event Hub / Sentinel, confidential computing and trusted-launch attestation, and direct mapping to regulatory framework controls. Together these policies protect against lateral movement, sovereign-data exfiltration, and audit gaps in regulated workloads. Maps to NIS2 Article…",
    "policyType": "Custom",
